## Algorithms and Data Structure Enhancements

The enhanced Travlr application introduced improved data processing capabilities within the administrative dashboard.

Enhancements included:

- Search functionality allowing users to filter trip data dynamically.
- Sorting algorithms allowing administrators to organize trips by name and price.
- Data transformation logic to convert formatted price strings into numerical values for comparison.

These enhancements improved the usability of the application while demonstrating practical implementation of algorithmic problem solving.
